# NOTE: legacy-domain (m-mafricankitchen.com) redirects cannot be done here —
# Cloudflare Pages _redirects only accepts path sources, not absolute URLs.
# Do it with a Redirect Rule / Bulk Redirect on the legacy zone, or attach the
